Every clinician should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
Every clinical-practice-organization should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
Every health-system should pursue a toxicology-testing-bias-minimization.
If a clinician has an assumption about a patient then it is recommended that the clinician does not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
If a clinical-practice-organization has an assumption about a patient then it is recommended that the clinical-practice-organization does not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
If a health-system has an assumption about a patient then it is recommended that the health-system does not differentially apply a toxicology-testing-recommendation to the patient.
